# Agent Orchestration

Default team:
- Master/Orchestrator
- Platform
- Lab Engine
- Security/Infrastructure
- Frontend/UX
- Verifier/QA

The user should normally give work to Master. Master decomposes and delegates.

Rules:
- Delegate by ownership boundary, not by arbitrary file count.
- Parallelize only independent tasks.
- Avoid simultaneous edits to the same ownership area unless intentionally coordinated.
- Security-sensitive work must be reviewed by Security Agent.
- No implementation task is complete until Verifier supplies appropriate evidence.
- Repository rules/docs are canonical memory; chat history is not.
